<p>Distorting spacetime around yourself, you reduce the movement speed of all enemies in radius 4 by 50% for <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">2, 2, 3, 4, 4</acronym> turns.</p><p>You use the siphoned speed to grant yourself incredible quickness for 1 turn, increasing movement speed by <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">100%, 167%, 218%, 261%, 300%,</acronym> increased by a further <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">12%, 20%, 27%, 32%, 37%</acronym> for each enemy slowed, to a maximum of 4.</p><p>Any actions other than movement will cancel the effect.</p>